<title>SRI LANKA: CRICKET-INDIA DECLARE FIRST INNINGS AT 537-8.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-INDIA DECLARE FIRST INNINGS AT 537-8.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1997-08-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>India declared their first innings at 537-8 shortly before close of play on the second day of the first test match against Sri Lanka in Colombo on Sunday.</p>
<p>Score: India 1st innings 537-8 declared (N.Sidhu 111, S.Tendulkar 143, M.Azharuddin 126)</p>
